From d1571bbcfb2a7b45a3391f7beb6c242b854f377e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sam Okafor <sam@example.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Mar 2026 10:15:00 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Admin tools: member lookup, bulk checkout, overdue report

The front desk asked for three things:

- a lookup box that finds members by part of their name
- checking out a stack of books for one member in a single request, all of
  them or none
- a list of overdue loans for the weekly reminder emails. A loan counts as
  overdue once it is more than 3 days past its due date (3 days of grace).

Adds GET /members/search, POST /loans/bulk and GET /reports/overdue.
Tests cover the new functions and the search route.
